resentation = tablet</a></li></ul><p><b>role</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://spor.ema.europa.eu/rmswi 72072}\">active</span></p><blockquote><p><b>substance</b></p><h3>Codes</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Concept</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:{https://gsrs.ncats.nih.gov/ginas/app/beta 1C6V77QF41}\">cholecalciferol</span></td></tr></table><h3>Strengths</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Presentation[x]</b></td><td><b>Basis</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>22 ug<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeug = 'ug')</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleClass ACTIB}\">active ingredient - basis of strength</span></td></tr></table></blockquote></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
